@baseUrl = http://localhost:7109
@accessToken = replace-with-a-valid-access-token
@studentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@semesterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Get a filtered page of assigned students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lecturer/students?semesterId={{semesterId}}&skip=0&take=20&sortBy=name
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get weekly timeline for an assigned student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lecturer/students/{{studentId}}/timeline?semesterId={{semesterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### An unassigned or missing student returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lecturer/students/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/timeline?semesterId={{semesterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
